# The tier 1 fixture (alpha gate #422, "Gate 2, tier 1"): a plain WordPress, NO WooCommerce, with
# the WordPress Theme Unit Test data, the standard content fixture for themes and plugins (posts,
# nested pages, menus, comments, images, every block type, and the edge cases: long titles, sticky
# and password-protected posts).
# Built by joan (seat joan-sb1114b) on 2026-11-13 from pinned inputs:
#   WordPress 7.1.4 (the build's WP_VERSION), sqlite-database-integration f05c1f9 (3.1.3, the
#   build's SQLITE_DI_REF), WordPress/theme-test-data at b47acf9, the WordPress Importer 0.9.7
#   through WP-CLI 2.12.0 (deactivated after the import). Theme twentytwentyfive, prefix wp_.
# It is a SQLite file made by the driver, NOT a MySQL dump: load it with
#   SQLITE=<the gunzipped file> CONTENT=<the wp-content archive> deploy/wfp/site import <site>
# The archive holds wp-content/uploads only (158 files). The old origin is http://localhost:8099.
# It holds credential-shaped rows: 3 users. admin has a random install password nobody kept;
# replace it on every load, as load-sample-store.sh does. themedemos and themereviewteam are
# subscribers made by the importer from the public test data. So the bucket is private.
# Uploaded and read back (sha256 matched) by the lead on 2026-11-13.
THEME_UNIT_BUCKET=wp-test-fixtures
THEME_UNIT_SQLITE_KEY=theme-unit/382c75b476ae2cf04b8f161ed4f4a0ace7549d01dba9ad7fcec01e242b7102bb.sqlite.gz
THEME_UNIT_SQLITE_SHA256=382c75b476ae2cf04b8f161ed4f4a0ace7549d01dba9ad7fcec01e242b7102bb
THEME_UNIT_SQLITE_BYTES=164955
THEME_UNIT_CONTENT_KEY=theme-unit/0530190ecb18a7313f9caaa12b432069328dc7b463f07e4929041031b0f13497.wp-content.tar.gz
THEME_UNIT_CONTENT_SHA256=0530190ecb18a7313f9caaa12b432069328dc7b463f07e4929041031b0f13497
THEME_UNIT_CONTENT_BYTES=46408754
# What a load must show (read back by the tier 1 loader).
THEME_UNIT_POSTS=59
THEME_UNIT_PAGES=23
THEME_UNIT_ATTACHMENTS=37
THEME_UNIT_COMMENTS=34
THEME_UNIT_USERS=3
